# Extra packages for the MacBook edition (all official repos except mbpfan, built from upstream in packages/)
# Wi-Fi: Broadcom BCM4360 (MacBookPro11,x and most 2012-2015 Macs) needs Broadcom's wl driver
broadcom-wl-dkms
# fans + heat: Apple SMC fan curve, Intel thermal daemon
mbpfan
thermald
# battery: power profiles (Super-quiet / balanced / performance) for the Vitals pod and GNOME-style tools
power-profiles-daemon
# Haswell/Broadwell hardware video decode (Firefox, Celluloid): saves a lot of CPU on video
libva-intel-driver
libva-utils
